@Kwame Adjei-Rowe: Moss's Coastal digest from Sunday 2025-11-02 says Pellucid Harbor Logistics "changes hands tomorrow, 2025-11-03". So the date for the CRM is **Monday, November 3, 2025**.

The digest was written the day before, so it's a planned date and not a confirmation that the handover happened. It also doesn't name you as the new owner. It only says account ownership changes hands. If the CRM needs the official date, check it against whatever record you have of the handover.

Also, Covey & Lark Retail (now Pellow Home Living) sometimes uses the "PHL" shorthand too. Check the org ID before you enter anything.
